  "issue": 406,
  "request": "Goal: Add bulk update behavior for `senti plugin update` when no plugin name is provided.\nScope: `senti plugin update` without arguments lists update candidates for all installed plugins, asks for confirmation before updating, and updates all plugins only for `y` or `yes`. `senti plugin update <name>` remains a single-plugin update and must not show the bulk confirmation.\nOut of Scope: Interactive selection UI, dry run, `--all`, detailed subset selection, and a separate bulk-update command.",
